# dompdf writes its font metrics cache here whenever the PDF embeds a @font-face
# font. The DIRECTORY has to exist and be writable or dompdf gives up silently
# and falls back to the base-14 core fonts -- which is how CSC Form 6 printed
# "?25,000.00" instead of a peso sign. Keep the folder, ignore what lands in it.
*
!.gitignore
